# Licences

This repository is licensed in two parts, because it holds two different
kinds of work.

**Code — MIT.** Everything under `tools/`: the checks, the case runner, the
view generation, and their fixtures. Full text in [LICENSE-MIT](LICENSE-MIT).

**Written material — CC BY 4.0.** Everything else: the skills, knowledge
entries, evidence records, cases, missions, generated views, the founder
profile, and the documentation at the root. Full text in
[LICENSE-CC-BY-4.0](LICENSE-CC-BY-4.0), also at
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/.

Attribute to Arthur Coulston, naming this repository. Where an entry records
its own author or reviewer, keep that credit with the material.

Third-party sources cited in `knowledge/` and `evidence/` keep their own
licences. Quoting and citing them here does not relicense them, and the terms
above do not extend to them.

Copyright (c) 2026 Arthur Coulston.
